OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest made after woman
OL,4,Afound dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after the body of a woman was
OL,8,Ffound.
OL,10,FOfficers were called by the ambulance
OL,11,Fservice to an address on Teignmouth
OL,12,FRoad, Torquay, just before 21:00 GMT on
OL,13,FTuesday.
OL,15,FParamedics confirmed the woman was
OL,16,Ffound dead at the scene, and her next
OL,17,Fof kin have been informed.
OL,19,FDevon and Cornwall Police said a man in
OL,20,Fhis 50s from Torquay has been arrested
OL,21,Fon suspicion of murder and other
OL,22,Foffences.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
